{
  "slug": "agent-handoff",
  "name": "Agent Handoff",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Strict 3-stage handoff workflow for coding agents — plan → execute → verify — with disk-backed state for cross-context handoff.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `execute` (Use after /plan to apply the planned changes), `plan` (Use when starting a new feature, fix, or refactor that needs explicit planning before code changes), `setup-handoff` (Use once per project before /plan, /execute, /verify), `verify` (Use after /execute to verify the changes are correct)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-handoff@claude-community` from `WillowRyu/agent-handoff`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "hook": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
